  "_doc": "f2p: Members are refits on the final store: d <= 1 h stack c7 (6 seeds), cs7 (3 seeds), mlp7 (3 seeds); 1-4 h stack c6s (3 seeds), c5s (3 seeds), c7 (6 seeds). Frozen weights: NNLS on each specification's 2025 A/B OOF (c7's from prc-c7x2, the earlier fs7 bank). Rows past 4 h: long stack (c6s, c5s, c7) blended with the physical estimate (plog, alpha 1); rows whose AOBT_3 is more than 4 h before takeoff and LIRF rows without AOBT_3 (long.fill = long_stack) take the long stack unblended. Overlay: LIRF rows without ADS-B evidence and d <= 4 h get 0.7 pred + 0.3 k4. Cap pred <= d past 2 h. Level calibration: lam 0.75, cap 0.05, composition offset fitted on the 2025 12-month-out c6 OOF. Post layers: lv_rules with rules 'ad' (NM join window, LEMD/LEBL cap), recovered (L0e), daily (L1a; parameters research/final/levers/artifacts/daily_params.json), which may not move rows that sit on an NM-window bound, recovered again. Assembler rules: NM join window +-3,631 s, LEMD/LEBL <= 3,604 s, floor 60.",
